Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE11AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[香　月]\n「等天攅了我也来鋩忙諦。」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE01BH
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
PutText 0,,[静　麻]\n「那就麻噸閙了。」
Calc 2,,CHARNAME = CE11AA
Call 0,,66,,-1
Calc 2,,DLG = ON
